{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_005_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a55fa72e2f3fffff28744a03390f35ab5221f6bd9ce980c2b59de3c0433a53d2", "ja": "（美奈子が、ショッピングモールのインストアライブに\n出演することになった。そろそろ本番だが……）", "zh": "（美奈子要在一家购物中心内举办店内演唱会。\n表演差不多要正式开始了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_005_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "36e305b076557f592ba659399ed600e291d300c8abd698d6c47cfec4b1824aad", "ja": "…………。\nあの時も、こんな感じだったなぁ……。", "zh": "…………\n那个时候，感觉也像这样呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_005_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7cf33a4caef1d0a00806860fdc8f317bb84bbc8d28a667c19b1b2221cef34052", "ja": "あの時？", "zh": "那个时候？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_005_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "788c3c738534c68c2839e839d173b6483065445ea40ab5a41595e7ce0976fc7e", "ja": "わっ、{$P$}さん！？\nび、ビックリしたぁ～。", "zh": "哇！{$P$}先生！？\n吓、吓了我一跳～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_005_1004_p", "source_sha256": "11fc7fa1fa64dcbbfac454c52d2ac1bf58db847daa2c822e923a90f54d8477f8", "ja": "ごめん、驚かすつもりはなかったんだけど……。\nあの時って、何かあったのか？", "zh": "抱歉，我不是故意要吓你的……\n你说那个时候，是指什么事情？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_005_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "e2163910c4d63e47a178e34efb8b7286d35d31de99aa4346a9844a2ceba87bbb", "ja": "えへへ……。大したことじゃないんですけど、\nちょっと、昔を思い出しちゃって。", "zh": "嘿嘿……不是什么大不了的事情啦，\n就是想起了一些往事而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_005_1006_p", "source_sha256": "00c4bad76aa43fb6d33db954f585a34546a70d39e58a1b401aca61590eb6c719", "ja": "昔？", "zh": "往事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_005_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "d2d41de02fcc0851b02f508bf3536bced1297cd674b6a8a7612d468ebaa66e81", "ja": "39プロジェクトのオーディションを受ける前、\n友達とここで、アイドルのライブを見たんです。", "zh": "在我参加39PROJECT的甄选之前，\n我曾经和朋友在这里看过偶像的演唱会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_005_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "688934b6ff2bbce1c03fe9ff45f27e5dc91ca730d964b1e66da739374fe9fe71", "ja": "その時、初めて生でアイドルを見たんですけど。\nもう、圧倒されちゃいました！", "zh": "当时是我第一次亲眼见到偶像，\n整个人都被震慑住了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_005_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "8da64f147fed6baf52f806bfb55e1805edbfa5025072c104b21f3d75ad2ae44b", "ja": "ステージの上のアイドル、キラキラ輝いてたな～……。\nすごく可愛くって、思わず夢中で応援しちゃいました！", "zh": "舞台上的偶像是那样闪耀动人……\n真的好可爱，我想也没想就忘我地声援起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_005_1010_p", "source_sha256": "8745e94d31fe1337a30e80ceece08d2d0062cd37772fc5bd233c65f7e04d891b", "ja": "いいライブだったんだな。\n美奈子の話しぶりから、それが伝わってくるよ。", "zh": "那场演唱会肯定很精彩吧，\n光听你的描述就感受得出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_005_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "4c5c641fe7d40b6d096cccff696c5ec3e166adf0eb4694b2f5310700ca40d0de", "ja": "はい！　あのライブを見てから私達、アイドルに\nなりたいってこと、真剣に考えるようになったんです。", "zh": "是啊！我们看过那场表演以后，\n就开始认真思考，如何实现想当偶像的愿望。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_005_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "fbe2a450a8a880dc5e755af4944570e34c601b0e1e94d2c4f2fb0d4315be3319", "ja": "それで、オーディションを受けようって決めたんです！\nと言っても、誘ってくれたのは友達なんですけど……。", "zh": "后来就决定要去参加甄选！\n话虽如此，邀我一起参加甄选的朋友却……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_005_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "ea087c4e352244f4bba3a1440e1aee3d8154adf91ddbe0eea5ac4937ade49513", "ja": "「3人で一緒にステージに立って、ここで歌おうね」\nって、約束して……。", "zh": "我们当初约定好，\n要三个人一起站上舞台，在这里唱歌的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_005_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "2e8539cb5df4062d56092ac135dea495beb974d6ecc158a2814c6ad69ad0190a", "ja": "その夢は叶いませんでしたけど……私が劇場の公演に\n出る時は、ステージを観に来てくれたりするんですよ！", "zh": "但这个梦想没有实现……\n不过我在剧场公演出场时，她们会来看我喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_005_1015_p", "source_sha256": "d689782160c0746385134ac065f1312bdf712400ff5b9fdc293a1aa51d236ecf", "ja": "そうだったのか。\n彼女達は美奈子にとって、いい友達なんだな。", "zh": "原来是这样啊，\n她们是美奈子的好朋友呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_005_1016_019min", "source_sha256": "5e080ca7fae61c864ccfbefdf5be0b777b9bf21d7c6dab0310f33924192c496d", "ja": "はい！　私のアイドル活動を、一生懸命応援してくれて\n……だから私も、2人の気持ちに応えたいんです！", "zh": "嗯！她们一直很拚命地支持我从事偶像活动……\n所以我也不想辜负她们的心意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_005_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "b5e528e24aa4250092f0292b62c528b151c47211dec925c6ee3a1704e283a433", "ja": "……でも、最初の約束と違って、\nステージに立つのは私1人なんですけどね。", "zh": "只不过……和一开始的约定不一样，\n如今站上舞台的，只有我一个人而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_005_1018_019min", "source_sha256": "ce72df0262003eea9e65f0dbd266605ef38e11d8324535e1948a2d38c67a618a", "ja": "だからって、不安になってちゃダメですよね。\n2人のためにも、私が頑張らないと！", "zh": "但即使如此，我也不能感到不安，对吧。\n我得加油才行，这也是为了她们两个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_005_1019", "source_sha256": "7f0d248617760076db71c62e26808aba2f54209c778eeff465254861ea610a3e", "ja": "不安になってもいい", "zh": "觉得不安也无妨", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_005_2000_p", "source_sha256": "a8757aef65329d90f5de779f4a9a4271bd2a6ffd9bb92c0ca271dbc7d76704ea", "ja": "不安になるのは当たり前だよ。\nでも、だからこそ、精いっぱいやればいい。", "zh": "会感到不安是很正常的，\n但正因为如此，只要尽全力去做就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_005_2001_p", "source_sha256": "5700b0f859c656f54d65c84150cb88173118578602c759b2e137aaf3d2c2a9b3", "ja": "そうやって美奈子が頑張っているからこそ、\n見ている人達は、感動してくれるんだと思う。", "zh": "我觉得，正是因为美奈子这么努力，\n台下的观众才会备受感动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_005_2002_p", "source_sha256": "b7cf378e95dab7b908ce292e8250a796586dcb743a5bc5489831eed0fe1c3ea2", "ja": "友達だけでなく、ファンの人達も。\n通りすがりの人達もな。", "zh": "不只是你的朋友，还有你的粉丝，\n就连路过的人们，也会为之动容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_005_2003_019min", "source_sha256": "d3805003bb407fe2a9aaedbd1ffb6a76daec03efda6e4cf6c09d6a96f7970894", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\nえへへ♪　そうですよね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n嘿嘿♪你说得没错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_005_2004_019min", "source_sha256": "d0c7d27ede8f65d7bd4add2151e0398dd7ceba786de2a5e89455b710df071dc0", "ja": "私って、幸せ者ですね？　友達だけじゃなく、\nたくさんの人達に応援してもらえるなんて。", "zh": "我很幸福对吧？不只是朋友，\n还有这么多人在声援我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_005_2005_019min", "source_sha256": "94d85b64ffc5824c069d97c5936308ab16800a875b90e18555bd5050ed3c573b", "ja": "私、頑張ります！　みんなに元気を届けるためにも、\n今日のステージで輝いてきますね♪　 2人の分まで！", "zh": "我会加油的！为了将活力带给大家，\n我会在今天的舞台上绽放光芒♪连她们俩的分一起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_005_2006_p", "source_sha256": "a9c498f066778da678376c79508765bcce6b9be5bf11611523e0c04c75883879", "ja": "（友達やファンの人達の応援を心から受けとめて、\n美奈子は思い出のステージに立つ……）", "zh": "（美奈子敞开心胸接受朋友和粉丝们的声援，\n站上了这个充满回忆的舞台……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_005_2007_p", "source_sha256": "3a674361c1ec822026f85a3423da93af881c0146972e001437fa4e91a8715d7a", "ja": "（きっと、このステージが終わる頃には、\n大輪の笑顔の花が咲いているはずだ）", "zh": "（我想，在表演落幕时，\n她的脸上肯定会挂着灿烂的笑容。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
